      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Use [`autoconnect()`](connectablepublisher/autoconnect().md) to simplify working with [`ConnectablePublisher`](connectablepublisher.md) instances, such as [`Timer.TimerPublisher`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/Timer/TimerPublisher) in the Foundation framework.",
      "normalizedSource": "Use [`autoconnect()`](connectablepublisher/autoconnect().md) to simplify working with [`ConnectablePublisher`](connectablepublisher.md) instances, such as [`Timer.TimerPublisher`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/Timer/TimerPublisher) in the Foundation framework.",
      "sourceHash": "87367a571421f792f113bea11e1d9da25646eade3cf97d02ad51f27d8c938e43",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
